  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Aligns LibreWPF preview.40 with immutable ProGPU preview.46; consumes retained WebGPU path operations, packed and copy-on-write path geometry, batched stroke expansion, compact paint/effect state, deferred save layers, ordered picture effects, and retained layer textures without a bridge workaround; retains the typed, zero-allocation media drawing-state seam, native activation, popup-local input diagnostics, bounded render-resource ownership, and static-frame render suppression; and preserves the Windows OLE clipboard and cross-platform input, popup, theme, WPFGallery, and designer gates.",
